# =========================
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
.vite/
**/.vite/
.cache/
**/.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# Keep lockfiles: pnpm-lock.yaml/package-lock.json/yarn.lock are useful for
# reproducible installs and should normally be committed.

